# SecureSourceNote — GitHub tracks ONLY the application code.
#
# All specification, research, planning, graphify, and scratch artifacts
# (the *.md corpus, deepresearch/, gemini/, harness/, AGENT_MEMORY.md,
# SecureSourceNote_MASTER_IDEA.md, ROADMAP.md, CLAUDE.md, scratch/, graphify-out/, …)
# stay local and are intentionally NOT published. They remain on disk for
# development; they are simply never committed.

# 1) Ignore everything at the repo root by default.
/*

# 2) Re-include only the application + repo-hygiene files.
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/core/
# Future app components — uncomment as they are built (ROADMAP S4/S5):
# !/clients/
# !/server/
# !/bindings/
# !/testkits/

# 3) Never track build output, env, or secrets, even under allowed dirs.
target/
.env
*.env
*.key
*.seed
